WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
1054.

2
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:05.190
The Church splits in two, East and West.

3
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.020
1517.

4
00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.680
In Wittenberg, a German monk and professor
challenges the sale of indulgences

5
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.080
with 95 theses.

6
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.660
1906.

7
00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:19.440
A new movement, Pentecostalism,
begins to grow fast,

8
00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.640
and spreads around the world.

9
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.770
All Christians follow Jesus.

10
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.330
So why are there Catholics, Orthodox,
Protestants and Pentecostals?

11
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.790
In this mission, you'll build
the family tree of the Churches,

12
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.430
branch by branch.

13
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.650
Then you'll find out what Luther taught,
and why his teaching split the Western

14
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.730
Church.

15
00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:42.330
Your mission: find out how
one Church became many,

16
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.960
and what Christians make of it.
